{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -c 'cat system-spec/fetched-references.json system-spec/retrieval-evidence/*.json'","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"references\": [\n    {\n      \"target_id\": \"postgres\",\n      \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:45:20Z\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/16/\",\n      \"official_publisher\": \"PostgreSQL Global Development Group\",\n      \"official_host\": \"www.postgresql.org\",\n      \"version\": \"16.15\",\n      \"latest_checked_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:45:20Z\",\n      \"evidence_ref\": \"system-spec/retrieval-evidence/postgres.json\",\n      \"evidence_sha256\": \"81468ee64b33aceba30eabe0557e4a8ae943682f18903fe69273c29bc1fdfd54\",\n      \"summary\": \"PostgreSQL 16 の公式文書 (16.15 版)。versioning ページでは 16 の現行マイナー版が 16.15、コミュニティ保守の終了 (最終リリース) が 2028-11-09。公式は各メジャー版の最新マイナー版での運用を推奨し、メジャー版は初回リリースから 5 年保守する。現行メジャーは 18 で、16 は保守対象。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"target_id\": \"react\",\n      \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:45:58Z\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://react.dev/versions\",\n      \"official_publisher\": \"Meta\",\n      \"official_host\": \"react.dev\",\n      \"version\": \"19.3\",\n      \"latest_checked_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:45:58Z\",\n      \"evidence_ref\": \"system-spec/retrieval-evidence/react.json\",\n      \"evidence_sha256\": \"25572ad42e64595c502042c90e060d095eba57a2bac76ca1be28dd3dea15963f\",\n      \"summary\": \"React の最新版は 19.3 (19.3.0、2026-09-09 リリース)。react.dev の文書は最新メジャー 19 を対象にし、旧メジャーは 18.react.dev などに保管される。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"target_id\": \"fastapi\",\n      \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:46:09Z\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/release-notes/\",\n      \"official_publisher\": \"FastAPI (Sebastián Ramírez / tiangolo)\",\n      \"official_host\": \"fastapi.tiangolo.com\",\n      \"version\": \"0.162.0\",\n      \"latest_checked_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:46:09Z\",\n      \"evidence_ref\": \"system-spec/retrieval-evidence/fastapi.json\",\n      \"evidence_sha256\": \"09b2fb8823462b795548d69746177648d302f39c812c74d7d4db613c0801fa1c\",\n      \"summary\": \"FastAPI の最新版は 0.162.0 (2026-10-23)。0.162.0 と 0.160.0 を含む直近のマイナー版に Breaking Changes の節があり、0.x 系のため採用時は版を固定して更新ごとに検証する。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"target_id\": \"typescript\",\n      \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:46:21Z\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.typescriptlang.org/download/\",\n      \"official_publisher\": \"Microsoft\",\n      \"official_host\": \"www.typescriptlang.org\",\n      \"version\": \"7.0\",\n      \"latest_checked_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:46:21Z\",\n      \"evidence_ref\": \"system-spec/retrieval-evidence/typescript.json\",\n      \"evidence_sha256\": \"2d325e0ab24b02985397b5794be8c588d7df1e126bed66e71b0e7aed05c182de\",\n      \"summary\": \"TypeScript の現行版は 7.0 (公式 download ページ: npm install -g typescript で 7.0 が入る)。7.1 は beta。文書ハブ https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/ は Handbook・Reference・Project Configuration を持つ。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"target_id\": \"kubernetes\",\n      \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-01T09:14:52.437427Z\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/controllers/cron-jobs/\",\n      \"official_publisher\": \"The Kubernetes Authors\",\n      \"official_host\": \"kubernetes.io\",\n      \"last_updated\": \"2026-05-13T21:32:47+01:00\",\n      \"latest_checked_at\": \"2026-11-01T09:14:52.437427Z\",\n      \"evidence_ref\": \"system-spec/retrieval-evidence/kubernetes.html\",\n      \"evidence_sha256\": \"5a2d3ee6094792da1d8ecb0dc9038e42f7a9101faf75511374bd68afda76b060\",\n      \"summary\": \"Kubernetes公式CronJob文書。CronJobは反復scheduleに基づきJobを作成する。重複実行や欠落が起こり得るためJobの冪等性が必要。concurrencyPolicyのForbidは同じCronJob由来Jobの並行を制限するが、業務効果のexactly-onceを保証しない。D4のDB一意キー・claim排他・lease/fencingによる重複反映防止を併用する。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n{\n  \"target_id\": \"fastapi\",\n  \"tool\": \"WebFetch\",\n  \"fetches\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/release-notes/\",\n      \"excerpt_verbatim\": [\n        \"0.162.0 (2026-10-23)\",\n        \"0.161.1 (2026-10-22)\",\n        \"0.160.0 (2026-10-22)\"\n      ],\n      \"notes\": \"Top of release notes. 0.162.0 and 0.160.0 contain 'Breaking Changes' sections (bullet text not read: page truncated by fetch tool at 100000 chars). Many 0.14x-0.16x releases in Oct 2026 include Breaking Changes, so pin the minor version.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:46:09Z\",\n  \"summary\": \"FastAPI の最新版は 0.162.0 (2026-10-23)。0.x 系で直近のマイナー版に破壊的変更が続くため、採用時は版を固定する。\"\n}\n{\n  \"target_id\": \"postgres\",\n  \"tool\": \"WebFetch\",\n  \"fetches\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/16/\",\n      \"excerpt_verbatim\": \"PostgreSQL 16.15 Documentation\",\n      \"page_title\": \"PostgreSQL: Documentation: 16: PostgreSQL 16.15 Documentation\",\n      \"notes\": \"Current: 18. Supported: 18, 17, 16, 15, 14. PostgreSQL 16 is supported but not the current major.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://www.postgresql.org/support/versioning/\",\n      \"excerpt_verbatim\": [\n        \"15 | 15.19 | Yes | October 13, 2022 | November 11, 2027\",\n        \"16 | 16.15 | Yes | September 14, 2023 | November 9, 2028\",\n        \"We recommend that users always run the current minor release associated with their major version.\",\n        \"The PostgreSQL Global Development Group supports a major version for 5 years after its initial release. After this, a final minor version will be released and the software will then be unsupported (end-of-life).\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:45:20Z\",\n  \"summary\": \"PostgreSQL 16 の現行マイナー版は 16.15。コミュニティ保守の最終リリース (EOL) は 2028-11-09。15 は 15.19 / EOL 2027-11-11。現行メジャーは 18。\"\n}\n{\n  \"target_id\": \"react\",\n  \"tool\": \"WebFetch\",\n  \"fetches\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://react.dev/versions\",\n      \"excerpt_verbatim\": [\n        \"## Latest version: 19.3\",\n        \"- [v19.3.0 (September 9, 2026)](https://github.com/react/react/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#1930-september-9-2026)\",\n        \"We aim to keep the docs updated within major versions, and do not publish versions for each minor or patch version.\"\n      ],\n      \"notes\": \"Previous majors archived at 18.react.dev etc. 19.2.x patches through 19.2.7 (June 2026).\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:45:58Z\",\n  \"summary\": \"React の最新版は 19.3 (19.3.0, 2026-09-09)。react.dev の文書は最新メジャー 19 を対象とする。\"\n}\n{\n  \"target_id\": \"typescript\",\n  \"tool\": \"WebFetch\",\n  \"fetches\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://www.typescriptlang.org/download/\",\n      \"excerpt_verbatim\": [\n        \"To do this, run `npm install -g typescript`. This will install the latest version (currently 7.0).\",\n        \"What's upcoming in 7.1?\",\n        \"What's new in 7.0\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/\",\n      \"notes\": \"Documentation hub (Handbook, Reference, Modules Reference, Project Configuration). No version label on the page; links to 'What's new in 7.0' and 7.1 beta.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-31T14:46:21Z\",\n  \"summary\": \"TypeScript の現行版は 7.0 (download ページ)。7.1 は beta。\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
